[h1]Extraction Mode - French Translation[/h1]

[b]Build 42.21 · Singleplayer & Multiplayer[/b]

Complete French translation of [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3785397275]Extraction Mode[/url] by Zakreon: interface, hideout and garage panels, quests and NPC dialogue, raid messages, items and sandbox options.

[h2]How to use[/h2]
[list]
[*]Enable [b]Extraction Mode[/b] and this mod.
[*]Set the game language to [b]Français[/b] in the game options.
[*]In multiplayer, each player sees the mod in their own language: install it on the server and the clients.
[/list]

[h2]Notes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Translation only: no gameplay change, safe to add or remove at any time.
[*]A few texts built directly in the original mod's code (without a translation key) stay in English.
[*]Based on Extraction Mode 0.9.6. New texts added by later updates appear in English until this translation is updated.
[/list]

[h2]Credits[/h2]
Extraction Mode is made by Zakreon. All rights to the original mod belong to its author. The poster is the original Extraction Mode artwork with a French ribbon added.
Translation files on [url=https://github.com/cyberbobjr/ExtractionModeFR]GitHub[/url].
